  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>L'Origane is a guest house on the heights of the village of L'Escarène (3918 chemin des Camps), in the Nice hinterland, 30 minutes from Nice and 45 minutes from Monaco. It offers 2 guest rooms on a separate floor (up to 5 people, each with its own bathroom) and a table d'hôtes, set in a 2-hectare olive grove with a pool in season. Open all year.</p>

      <h2>Dogs: pets not accepted</h2>
      <p>The tourist office listing (Côte d'Azur France, updated on 29 March 2024 by the Pays des Paillons community of communes) lists "<strong>Animals not accepted</strong>" among the establishment's services and gives opening all year 2026, every day. The establishment's own website could not be reached on 20/11/2026.</p>
      <p>A specialised directory (emmenetonchien.com, a listing shared by a traveller and updated in February 2023) described a free welcome for 2 dogs under 30 kg. That information predates the tourist office listing, which takes precedence.</p>
      <p><strong>Worth checking before you go:</strong> if you still wish to stay here with your dog, ask the establishment for confirmation before booking. Google Maps also reports the establishment as permanently closed, while the tourist office gives it as open all year: check that it still takes guests.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The tourist office listing places the house 30 minutes from Nice and the coast and 45 minutes from Monaco and the Italian border, in the Nice hinterland.</p>
    </div>

